text = "Hello Royalty Collage of the Paper Trail Kingdom,

It is I, King Gustav II Adolph, the former King of Sweden. You may be wondering, how am I here, writing to you one of these fine… um… what are these things called..? Oh yes, “emails”! Well, you see, I am summoned back to life when I see an ethical dilemma about, and that certainly is what is happening right now… 

You see, I must make sure that Academic Honesty is being upheld at the Kingdom of “GAC” in St. Peter, Minnesota, but I have noticed some duplicitous behavior occurring between a Royal and a Peasant! Oh my! 

I must convince the Royal Provost that allowing the Peasant Student to get a higher grade in this class is of the utmost stupidity. 

Could you please make me a collage that is both sad and dark so I can convey my distaste with the Provost’s decision? I will be sending it to her after you make it.

Regards,
Gustav II Adolph 
King of Sweden (1611-1632)

(P.S. There is a surprising lack of carrier pigeons in the area. Do you have no class in the modern day?)
"
